r usage window independently configurable and show[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]compact, truthful capacity and reset countdowns with clear [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ten-bucket colors in ACE.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]usage_window_indicators.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/usage_window_indicators.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-z7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-z7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Define shared usage window identity and visibility policy[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]window-policy[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]window-policy: implement Rust classification, policy validation and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selection, time-aware projection, bindings, and contract tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Integrate configuration and time-aware cached display data[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config-and-cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]after window-policy[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-and-cache: integrate Python adapters, schema and defaults, live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config invalidation, documentation, and the Usage Window glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strand.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render and verify the compact usage window display[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]compact-display[dim] · [dim][/dim]after window-policy, config-and-cache[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]